<title>FINLAND: TENNIS-GREECE LEAD FINLAND 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GREECE LEAD FINLAND 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland reduced Greece's lead to 2-1 after winning the doubles in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, first round tie on Saturday:</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Tuomas Ketola/Ville Liukko beat Anastasios Vasiliadis/Konstantinos Economidis 6-3 7-6 6-4.</p>
</text>
